Pet owners are now able to add pet hosts to their favorites list. Simply call the mutation below passing an existing Host ID.

This mutation returns a boolean value:

- true: the operation worked successfully;
- false: if you try to favorite the host more than once or if you provide an incorrect Host UUID;

```
mutation addHostToFavorites {
  addHostToFavorites(hostId: "c3b8f2fc-6f2d-4fdd-b463-b56ff112da23")
}
```
